<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Dsh on All about Raspberry Pi</title><link>https://hugozhu.site/tags/dsh/</link><description>Recent content in Dsh on All about Raspberry Pi</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://hugozhu.site/tags/dsh/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>把数字员工「编译」出来：profile 组装里的静默坑</title><link>https://hugozhu.site/post/2026/451-compiling-digital-employee-profile-assembly/</link><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://hugozhu.site/post/2026/451-compiling-digital-employee-profile-assembly/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;面向在 Agent harness 上做应用的工程师。你已经会写插件、调 persona。这篇讲一件更朴素的事：&lt;strong&gt;一个员工的定义，是怎么变成一个能跑的进程目录的&lt;/strong&gt; —— 以及这一步里那些「违反时不报错」的坑。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;案例来自本仓库：跑在 DeepSeek Harness（dsh）上的钉钉数字员工。入口是 &lt;code&gt;make build&lt;/code&gt;，实现在 &lt;code&gt;bin/employee&lt;/code&gt; 的 &lt;code&gt;build()&lt;/code&gt;。dsh 底座本身的理念与细节，见 &lt;a href="https://hugozhu.site/post/2026/368-dsh-microkernel-to-b-philosophy/"&gt;DSH 微内核架构：数字员工的 To B 哲学&lt;/a&gt; 和 &lt;a href="https://hugozhu.site/post/2026/348-dsh-three-details-reversible-effects/"&gt;一切皆插件：DeepSeek Harness 真正硬核的是三个细节&lt;/a&gt;；本篇只讲组装的工程。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://hugozhu.site/img/2026/compiling-digital-employee.png"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hugozhu.site/img/2026/compiling-digital-employee-thumb.jpg" alt="Compiling a Digital Employee: The Silent Traps of Profile Assembly"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>